d 100-499 (see counselor). AA/AS requirements: 60 degree-applicable units, 2.0 GPA, 12 units within Los Rios, SCC Local GE Areas L1A-L7B (Cal-GETC may be used instead). tccns mirrors SCC local course codes (California community colleges do not use TCCNS).",
